      "worked": "Reorder the factors and repeatedly use the difference of squares.\n$$\\begin{align*}(x-y)(x^2+y^2)(x+y)(x^4+y^4)&=(x-y)(x+y)(x^2+y^2)(x^4+y^4)\\\\(x-y)(x^2+y^2)(x+y)(x^4+y^4)&=(x^2-y^2)(x^2+y^2)(x^4+y^4)\\\\(x-y)(x^2+y^2)(x+y)(x^4+y^4)&=(x^4-y^4)(x^4+y^4)\\\\(x-y)(x^2+y^2)(x+y)(x^4+y^4)&=x^8-y^8\\end{align*}$$",
